{
  "_comment": [
    "Orders the planner has to get right, with the answer Jev is imagined to give and",
    "the decision that should fall out of it. The `jev` block is NOT a prediction of",
    "what the real model will say - it is the input to everything downstream, so that",
    "item reading, the confidence floor, the chest guard and the reply table can be",
    "tested without a key. When early access arrives, record the real answers and",
    "replace each `jev` block: anything that then fails is a genuine disagreement",
    "between the model and the planner, which is exactly what needs finding.",
    "",
    "`direct` marks an order the plugin's own table answers, so Jev is never asked.",
    "`matches` is a regex fallback for orders not listed literally."
  ],
